# Portfolio config and data

- **Manifest:** `config/projects.manifest.yaml` lists slugs; each slug has a folder `config/projects/<slug>/`.
- **YAML:** `<slug>.yml` holds identity, URLs, `currentPhase`, `jiraProjectKey`, `githubRepo`, and tab copy. Prefer editing YAML over hardcoding in TS.
- **JSON mirrors:** `data_sprint_progress.json` / `data_github_activity.json` — same shapes as the dashboard files. Refresh via `.github/workflows/portfolio-sync-*.yml` and `config/ci-sync-manifest.json`, or copy from `aaa-client-dashboard` after its Actions run.
- **Commercial (internal):** YAML `commercial:` — `status`, `proposalAmount`, `contractedAmount`, `collectedAmount`, `winProbability`, optional `entries` (`date`, `amount`, `kind: collected|forecast`) for dashboard revenue timeline. Drives dashboard rollup/chart and project detail Revenue tile. Not shown on client publish.
- **Loader:** `src/server/portfolio/load-config.ts` and `sprint-github.ts` — keep types aligned with `src/feature/portfolio/types.ts`.
- **Comments:** `data_comments.json` is read-only in MVP; writes go through a planned Next.js Route Handler (see `docs/PLANS.md` §7.6). Do not call Slack webhooks from the browser.
- **Milestones (optional):** `milestones.yaml` in each `projects/<slug>/` drives the delivery milestone rail on the project detail page (`title`, `startedAt`, `completed`). Omit the file to use the Jira-derived fallback bar only.
- **Sales meetings:** `data_sales_meetings.json` — `{ "meetings": [{ id, source, meeting, date, attendees, transcript }] }`. YAML `sales.meetings` is legacy fallback only.
- **Phase markdown:** `discovery/`, `qa/`, `uat/`, `maintenance/` folders — one or more `*.md` files (frontmatter + markdown body). Build tab still uses Jira/GitHub JSON only.
- **Team (optional):** YAML `team:` — `sales` (default Brad Wilcox), `qa` (default Javier), optional `pm`, `clients` (array), `engineers` (array). Drives Strategic stakeholders on the detail page.

CEO data: `ceo-init` / `ceo-update`. Engineering: `dev-new-feature` (includes manifest, sync, loader). Mirrored under `.claude/skills/`.
